    "new": "<img alt=\"Four-step figure for drawing an amine, CH3CH2NHCH3. Step 1: draw the chain with the heteroatom in it, C-C-N-C. Step 2: carbon gets four bonds and nitrogen three; add the missing H atoms (expanded formula). Step 3: condense to CH3CH2NHCH3. Step 4: draw the zigzag skeletal formula with the N shown in blue together with its H.\" class=\"internal\" src=\"/@api/deki/files/{{s2}}/fig-p597060-steps-amine.png\" fileid=\"{{s2}}\" />",
    "count": 1,
    "note": "1.7 Example 2 steps: also, This is the"
